.venv/

# Keep the compiled manuscript, drop everything else under paper/build/
!paper/build/main.pdf

# code/upstream/ is a clone of github.com/Ali-M658/Arithmetic-verification.
# Left untracked deliberately: it carries its own .git, and that history holds
# the four scripts deleted on 2026-08-08 that the claim ledger relies on.
# Re-create with:
#   git clone https://github.com/Ali-M658/Arithmetic-verification.git code/upstream
code/upstream/

# numerics: private environment, fetched reference PDFs, raw solver runs
numerics/.venv/
numerics/refs_cache/
numerics/runs/

# theory/locality: fetched sources (re-create with theory/locality/fetch_sources.sh)
theory/locality/sources_cache/
# numerics/moduli: raw solver runs and eigenfunction dumps (regenerated by the scripts)
numerics/moduli/runs/
research/raw/*.pdf
paper/build/

# figures: fetched third-party guideline pages, papers and images (study only, never committed)
figures/_fetched/
figures/build/

# review/referee-sim: the manuscript PDF given to the simulated referees and their scratch work
review/referee-sim/_input/
review/referee-sim/*/scratch/

# Compiled manuscripts (build outputs only; figures/out/ is tracked)
paper/arith/*.pdf
paper/arith/integers/note.pdf
paper/jga/*.pdf
paper/submission/*.pdf
paper/submission/build/

# Zenodo deposit archive built by git archive (paper/SUBMISSION-CHECKLIST.md, section 5)
paper/submission/deposit/

# arXiv source packages built by paper/tools/make_arxiv.py (regenerated from the built papers)
paper/arxiv/

